# ==========================================================================
# Netlify _redirects — M/S Alok S Kumar And Company
# Canonical origin: https://www.alokskumar.com  (HTTPS + www)
#
# Use EITHER this file OR netlify.toml — do not maintain both. If both are
# present, netlify.toml rules are evaluated first.
#
# Netlify already serves /path/index.html for /path/ (Pretty URLs) and forces
# HTTPS once the certificate is issued, so neither needs a rule here.
# For non-www -> www, set www.alokskumar.com as the PRIMARY domain in
# Domain management; Netlify then 301s the apex automatically. The host rules
# below are a fallback for old domains still pointing at this site.
#
# Format:  from   to   status[!]     ("!" = force, overrides an existing file)
# ==========================================================================

# --- Host canonicalisation -----------------------------------------------
https://alokskumar.com/*            https://www.alokskumar.com/:splat        301!
https://alokskumarandco.com/*       https://www.alokskumar.com/:splat        301!
https://www.alokskumarandco.com/*   https://www.alokskumar.com/:splat        301!

